      "role": "user",
      "content": "im troubleshooting a CrashLoopBackOff in GKE on our api-service pod. logs show a liveness probe failure: `Get \"http://10.48.1.15:8080/healthz\": dial tcp 10.48.1.15:8080: connect: connection refused`. \n\ncould u provide a technical diagnostic checklist to determine if this is a resource limit issue, a misconfigured probe, or a startup failure? i need to rule out OOMKilled vs a bad config. keep it concise.",
